o Pharmaceuticals Ltd."}, "thanh_phan_chi_tiet": {"hoat_chat": "Clotrimazol 10mg"}}	t	biroxime-1-y-med-tuyp-20g-	2676	4.7	2026-04-08 21:43:22.227956	DaDuyet
